shes the same one-server configuration, so this check is expected to record a bounded holds rather than a new violation, deliberately corroborating the protection that source reading already explained. The rationale states that framing explicitly so it is not presented as a fresh defect, and the limitations record that the strongest sub-case (a conflict at or below the committed configuration index) and other suffixes are not exercised. Preflight validation returns valid with no diagnostics.\"}"}}
